OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 4 MAY
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GCedric Tiberghien joins the
OL,6,     GBournemouth Symphony Orchestra
OL,7,     Gfor Tchaikovsky's Piano Concerto
OL,8,     Gno.1, along with French music by
OL,9,     GLili Boulanger and Saint-Saens'
OL,10,     GOrgan Symphony.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: The Insect Singers
OL,12,     GThe Essay celebrates the
OL,13,     Gmusicality and noise of our
OL,14,     Ginsect singers. 1. Let Those Bugs
OL,15,     GSing. Writer and musician David
OL,16,     GRothenberg wonders what the
OL,17,     Ginsect singers have taught us.
